# CSharpier skips .godot/, obj/ and bin/ on its own, but not addons/.
#
# Godot installs third-party plugins into addons/, and their C# sources compile
# as part of your project - so `csharpier check .` reports them as unformatted
# and `make lint` fails on code you did not write. Reformatting them instead
# would leave a permanent diff against upstream that every plugin update
# conflicts with.
addons/

# Uncomment for a plugin you actually maintain in-tree and want formatted:
# !addons/my-own-plugin/
